# What this module is

Wear OS smartwatch companion for Universal Installer.
Handles sideloading APKs directly to the watch, viewing installation queue,
and communicating with the phone application.

Derived: 52 translatable string(s) (+1 translatable="false") across 18 locale(s), in `strings.xml`.

## Audience & tone

Ultra-terse, compact, and action-oriented for tiny round and square smartwatch screens.
Avoid lengthy descriptions; labels must fit minimal screen space.
Use direct register: `vi` uses "bạn", `pt-BR` uses "você".

## Do not translate

- API
- Wi-Fi
- Wear OS
- Universal Installer

## Glossary

| term | locale | translation |
| --- | --- | --- |
| install | vi | cài đặt |
| apps | vi | ứng dụng |
| watch | vi | đồng hồ |
| package | vi | gói |
| queue | vi | hàng đợi |
| installed | vi | đã cài đặt |
| settings | vi | cài đặt |
| phone | vi | điện thoại |

## Notes per locale

- `ar` — Arabic (RTL, CLDR requires all six plural quantities: zero, one, two, few, many, other)
- `de` — German (informal/direct UI register)
- `el` — Greek
- `es` — Spanish (standard direct second-person "tú")
- `fr` — French (standard polite UI register "vous")
- `hi` — Hindi
- `in` — Indonesian (Android's legacy code `in`, never write `id` in CSV)
- `it` — Italian
- `ja` — Japanese
- `ko` — Korean
- `pl` — Polish
- `pt-BR` — Brazilian Portuguese (uses "você")
- `ro` — Romanian
- `ru` — Russian
- `tr` — Turkish
- `uk` — Ukrainian
- `vi` — Vietnamese (uses pronoun "bạn", "cài đặt" for install, "đồng hồ" for watch)
- `zh` — Simplified Chinese (简体中文: uses "安装", "设置", "手表")
